<div class="page-wrap account-page"><div class="eyebrow">PERSONAL LEARNING PROFILE</div><div class="page-heading"><h1>个人中心</h1><p>使用 GitHub 身份登录，维护基本资料、学习进度与常用入口。</p></div><section class="account-summary"><div class="account-avatar" id="account-avatar"><%- icon('book') %></div><div class="account-identity"><h2 id="account-name">尚未登录</h2><p id="account-state" aria-live="polite">正在检查登录服务…</p></div><button class="button" id="sign-in" disabled><%- icon('github') %> 使用 GitHub 登录</button><button class="button secondary" id="sign-out" hidden>退出登录</button></section><div class="account-error" id="account-error" role="alert" hidden></div><section class="account-quick"><div class="section-heading"><h2>常用入口</h2><span class="muted" id="shortcuts-hint">登录后可调整显示项目</span></div><div class="quick-links" id="account-shortcuts"><a href="/courses/"><%- icon('book') %><span>课程学习</span></a><a href="/commands/"><%- icon('terminal') %><span>命令查询</span></a><a href="/dictionaries/"><%- icon('file') %><span>文件与 Dict</span></a><a href="/assignments/"><%- icon('task') %><span>作业中心</span></a><a href="/community/"><%- icon('chat') %><span>提问答疑</span></a><a href="/resources/"><%- icon('download') %><span>资料下载</span></a></div></section><div class="profile-grid"><section class="profile-editor"><h2>基本资料</h2><p class="muted">填写用于学习管理的信息。个人资料仅当前登录账号可读写，不作为教师权限的依据。</p><form id="profile-form"><fieldset id="profile-fields" disabled><div class="form-grid"><label class="form-field"><span>显示名称</span><input name="display_name" maxlength="50" required autocomplete="nickname"></label><label class="form-field"><span>单位或学校（选填）</span><input name="institution" maxlength="100" autocomplete="organization"></label></div><label class="form-field"><span>研究方向（选填）</span><input name="research" maxlength="200" placeholder="例如：气液两相流、电化学传质"></label><label class="form-field"><span>当前学习阶段</span><select name="level"><option value="beginner">入门：环境与基本操作</option><option value="intermediate">进阶：网格与数值方法</option><option value="research">应用：多相流与模型开发</option></select></label><label class="form-field"><span>学习目标（选填）</span><textarea name="bio" maxlength="400" placeholder="记录近期需要掌握的方法或拟完成的算例。"></textarea></label><div class="form-field"><span>常用入口</span><div class="shortcut-options"><% [['courses','课程学习'],['commands','命令查询'],['dictionaries','文件与 Dict'],['assignments','作业中心'],['community','提问答疑'],['resources','资料下载']].forEach(([id,label])=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="shortcuts" value="<%= id %>" checked> <%= label %></label><% }); %></div></div><button class="button" type="submit">保存个人资料</button><p class="form-message" id="profile-message" role="status"></p></fieldset></form></section><aside class="profile-progress"><div class="section-kicker">COURSE PROGRESS</div><h2>学习进度</h2><div class="progress-total"><strong id="account-completed">—</strong><span>/ 28 讲</span></div><p id="account-progress-state">登录后显示账号的学习记录。</p><div class="progress-track"><span id="account-progress-bar"></span></div><a class="button secondary" href="/courses/" id="account-continue">查看课程目录 →</a><button class="button secondary" id="import-progress" hidden>导入本机学习记录</button><p class="muted">课程阅读页提供完成标记。登录状态下，记录保存到账号并可在其他设备读取。</p><div class="profile-links" id="github-personal-links" hidden><h3>公开课堂记录</h3><a id="my-submissions" href="https://github.com/MrLittleShark/MrLittleShark.github.io/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我的作业提交 ↗</a><a id="my-questions" href="https://github.com/MrLittleShark/MrLittleShark.github.io/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我的提问 ↗</a></div></aside></div></div>
